><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar high in the Sky Mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious Deep Woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the tricky maze in the Jungle Arenas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack:</strong> Race to finish in best possible time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Campaign:</strong> Explore 4 distinct worlds and master 70+ developer tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online PvP: </strong>Compete against other players in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghosts:</strong> Follow or race anyone, whenever you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Competition: </strong>Climb the leaderboards and prove you’re the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Mode:</strong> Unleash your creativity, build maps, and show them off to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Get faster and smoother with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unprecedented Freedom:</strong> Find your own path, explore and master tracks your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friendly Community:</strong> Share your creations and strats with the Official Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Master rocket-powered parkour! Boost, slide, wallrun, and fly through 70+ handcrafted levels... or build your own in Create Mode. Play solo, race online, or climb the leaderboards in async multiplayer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite